        "question": "<div class=\"question\" dir=\"rtl\">برای ماتریس <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  A=\\begin{bmatrix}\n-2 &amp;1 \\\\ \n5 &amp;4 \n\\end{bmatrix}$</span>&nbsp; رابطۀ&nbsp;<span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  A^{2}=\\alpha A+\\beta I $</span>&nbsp;برقرار است. دوتایی <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle (\\alpha,\\beta)$</span> کدام است؟</div>",
        "mediaHasRequested": false,
        "topics": "{\"idList\":[{\"id\":33717}]}",
        "cnt": "781",
        "isExamSingleQuestion": false,
        "choice4selectedCounts": 24,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">ماتریس <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A^{2} $</span> را یافته و در رابطۀ داده شده قرار می‌دهیم:<br>روش اول:&nbsp; <br><div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle {{A}^{2}}=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} -2 &amp; 1 \\\\ 5 &amp; 4 \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]\\times \\left[ \\begin{matrix} -2 &amp; 1 \\\\ 5 &amp; 4 \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} 9 &amp; 2 \\\\ 10 &amp; 21 \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]$</span><br><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\left[ \\begin{matrix} 9 &amp; 2 \\\\ 10 &amp; 21 \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} -2\\alpha &amp; \\alpha \\\\ 5\\alpha &amp; 4\\alpha \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]+\\left[ \\begin{matrix} \\beta &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; \\beta \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} -2\\alpha+\\beta &amp;\\alpha \\\\ 5\\alpha &amp; 4\\alpha+\\beta \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{ll} &amp; \\alpha =2 \\\\ &amp; \\beta =13 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right.$</span></div><div align=\"left\"><div align=\"right\">روش دوم: (نکته) هر ماتریس <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle 2\\times 2 $</span> مانند&nbsp;<span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A $</span> در رابطۀ زیر صدق می‌کند:<br><div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  A=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} a &amp; b \\\\ c &amp; d \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right]\\Rightarrow {{A}^{2}}-\\left( a+d \\right)A+\\left| A \\right|I=\\overline{O}$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A=\\left[ \\begin{matrix} -2 &amp; 1 \\\\ 5 &amp; 4 \\\\ \\end{matrix} \\right] \\Rightarrow {{A}^{2}}-2A-13I=\\overline{O} \\Rightarrow {{A}^{2}}=2A+13I \\Rightarrow \\alpha =2,\\beta =13 $</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div></div></div>",
