        "question": "<div class=\"question\" dir=\"rtl\">اگر <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AB=B$</span> و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle BA=A$</span> حاصل <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle (A+B)(A-B)$</span> کدام است؟</div>",
