        "topics": "{\"idList\":[{\"id\":33716}]}",
        "cnt": "781",
        "authorId": "212686",
        "isExamSingleQuestion": false,
        "choice4selectedCounts": 30,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">\n‌با توجه به فرض سؤال داریم:<div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle AB=B\\xrightarrow{A=BA}B\\underbrace{AB}_{B}=B\\to {{B}^{2}}=B \\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle BA=A\\xrightarrow{B=AB}A\\underbrace{BA}_{A}=A\\to {{A}^{2}}=A \\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle (A+B)(A-B)=\\underbrace{{{A}^{2}}}_{A}-\\underbrace{AB}_{B}+\\underbrace{BA}_{A}-\\underbrace{{{B}^{2}}}_{B}=2A-2B$</span></div></div>",
