        "question": "<div class=\"question\" dir=\"rtl\">اگر <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 &amp; 2&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -3 &amp; 2&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]$</span> و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle B=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 &amp; -2&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 &amp; 0&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]$</span> حاصل <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle {{A}^{-1}}({{B}^{-1}}+{{A}^{-1}})^{-1}{{B}^{-1}}$</span> کدام است؟</div>",
        "mediaHasRequested": false,
        "topics": "{\"idList\":[{\"id\":23768}]}",
        "cnt": "781",
        "authorId": "212686",
        "isExamSingleQuestion": false,
        "choice4selectedCounts": 33,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">(نکته) برای سه ماتریس مربعی هم‌مرتبه <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  P , N , M$</span>‌ رابطۀ <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  M^{-1}N^{-1}P^{-1}=(PNM)^{-1}$</span> برقرار است. طبق این نکته داریم:<br><div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle {{A}^{-1}}({{B}^{-1}}+{{A}^{-1}})^{-1}{{B}^{-1}}={{(B({{B}^{-1}}+{{A}^{-1}})A)}^{-1}}\\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle ={{((I+B{{A}^{-1}})A)}^{-1}}={{(A+B)}^{-1}}={{(\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 &amp; 2&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -3 &amp; 2&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]+\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 &amp; -2&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 &amp; 0&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right])}^{-1}}\\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle = \\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 &amp; 0&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 0 &amp; 2&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]^{-1}=(2I)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{2}I $</span></div></div>",
