        "isExamSingleQuestion": false,
        "choice4selectedCounts": 41,
        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\"><table class=\"layoutdualColumn\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"dualColumnFirstCell\" align=\"right\">&nbsp;نکته: اگر <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A $</span> ماتریس مربعی <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  n\\times n$</span> باشد و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle k \\in \\mathbb{R}$</span> آنگاه:</td><td class=\"dualColumnSecondCell\" align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle 1)|kA| = k^{n}|A| \\\\ 2) |A^{n}| = |A|^{n}$</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div align=\"left\"><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle  A^{2} = -I \\Rightarrow |A^{2}| = |-I| \\rightarrow |A|^{2} = (-1)^{2}|I| = 1\\xrightarrow{|A|&gt;0} |A| = 1\\\\ |I - A|^{2} = |(I - A)^{2}| = |I^{2} - 2AI + A^{2}| = |I - 2A - I|\\\\ = |-2A| = (-2)^{2} |A| = 4 \\times 1 = 4 \\Rightarrow |I - A| = \\pm2$</span></div></div>",
