        "answer": "<div class=\"answer\" dir=\"rtl\">\n‌ماتریس‌های <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A^{2} $</span> و <span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle A^{3} $</span> را به دست می‌آوریم:<div align=\"left\"><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle {{A}^{2}}=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{1}{2} &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{3}{4} &amp; \\dfrac{1}{2}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{1}{2} &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{3}{4} &amp; \\dfrac{1}{2}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -\\dfrac{1}{2} &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{3}{4} &amp; -\\dfrac{1}{2}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right] \\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle {{A}^{3}}={{A}^{2}}A=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -\\dfrac{1}{2} &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;\\dfrac{3}{4} &amp; -\\dfrac{1}{2}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{1}{2} &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; \\dfrac{3}{4} &amp; \\dfrac{1}{2}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]=\\left[ \\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -1 &amp; 0&nbsp; \\\\<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 0 &amp; -1&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix} \\right]=-I \\\\$</span><br><span class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\to {{A}^{3}}=-I\\xrightarrow{\\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 33 &amp;\\!\\!\\!\\!\\text{طرفین به توان}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix}}{{A}^{99}}=-I\\xrightarrow[\\text{ضرب می‌کنیم}]{\\begin{matrix}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; {{A}^{2}} &amp;\\!\\!\\!\\!\\text{طرفین را در}&nbsp; \\\\<br>\\end{matrix}}{{A}^{101}}=-{{A}^{2}}$</span></div></div>",
